Here's the proper configuration sequence to implement BGP ORF with extended community negotiation on your Nokia routers:

```
# Enter BGP configuration context
configure router bgp

    # Configure ORF globally or for specific group/neighbor
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            send-orf
            accept-orf
        exit
    exit

    # Optional: Apply immediate update sending after session establishment
    initial-send-delay-zero

    # Optional: Set prefix limits for stability
    group <PEER_GROUP_NAME>
        prefix-limit ipv4 <MAX_ROUTES> threshold 75 idle-timeout 30
    exit

exit
```

For a more targeted neighbor-specific configuration:
```
configure router bgp
    group <PEER_GROUP_NAME>
        neighbor <IP_ADDRESS>
            outbound-route-filtering
                extended-community
                    send-orf
                    accept-orf
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```
