To extend the stale route retention period to a full day (86,400 seconds) during BGP graceful restart, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 86400
exit
```

If you need to configure this at the group or neighbor level instead of globally, use these variations:

For group-level configuration:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 86400
exit
```

For neighbor-level configuration:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 86400
exit
