    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables static route usage for BGP next-hop resolution (`allow-static`) while excluding default static routes
2. Configures next-hop resolution for labeled IPv4/IPv6 and VPN routes using BGP transport tunnels
3. Sets up shortcut tunnels for unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes

The solution ensures recursive next-hop resolution through static routes while maintaining control over the path selection process during your migration.
