"During a multi-vendor network migration where we're integrating huawei routers into our existing BGP topology, what’s the recommended approach for configuring path selection logic when evaluating routes received from disparate autonomous systems, particularly if some peers omit the MED attribute—should those routes default to the maximum MED value for consistent decision-making?"
