To disable AS-path length consideration for labeled-IPv6 and L2VPN routes while maintaining normal behavior for regular IPv4 unicast, use the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    as-path-ignore label-ipv6 l2-vpn
exit
```

This command will exclude AS-path length from the best-path selection process for labeled IPv6 and L2VPN routes only, leaving IPv4 unicast routing unaffected.
