To access and modify BGP best-path selection parameters on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI sequence:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ignore-router-id
        exit
    exit
```

This will take you to the `best-path-selection` hierarchy where you can adjust parameters like `ignore-router-id`. For example, to enable `ignore-router-id` for specific address families, you would add:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv4 mvpn-ipv6
        exit
    exit
```
