To activate BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR without triggering secondary authentication, use the following minimal configuration:

```
configure router
    bgp
        no shutdown
exit all
```

This enables BGP administratively without additional features that might require approvals. The protocol is automatically enabled upon creation, but explicitly removing any potential `shutdown` state ensures it's operational. No other parameters are required unless you specifically need inter-AS VPN functionality or rapid withdrawal.
