To configure tunneled next-hop resolution for IPv4 labeled routes on your Nokia 7750 platform, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter bgp
            exit
            shortcut-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter bgp
        exit
    exit
exit
```

If you need to apply a specific policy for next-hop resolution, add the policy under `next-hop-resolution`:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            policy "<policy-name>"
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<policy-name>` with your actual route policy name. This ensures BGP-labeled IPv4 routes will resolve next-hops using BGP tunnels while maintaining forwarding consistency during your MPLS core migration.
