To enable BMP protocol monitoring for BGP peering sessions on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "STATION_NAME"
            connection
                router "ROUTER_INSTANCE"
            exit
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `STATION_NAME` with your BMP monitoring station name and `ROUTER_INSTANCE` with the appropriate router instance or VPRN service ID. This configuration will enable both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring for the specified BMP station.
