To configure your Nokia router to consider RPKI origin validation results in the BGP best-path algorithm while preserving existing policy-based preferences, use the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        compare-origin-validation-state
    exit
exit
```

This configuration inserts RPKI validation state comparison into the BGP decision process after route validity checks but before local preference evaluation. Routes with valid RPKI states will be preferred over those with not-found states, which in turn will be preferred over invalid states, all while maintaining your existing route preference hierarchy.
