To ensure deterministic best-path selection based on MED values in a multi-vendor BGP peering scenario, use the following configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        deterministic-med
        always-compare-med zero
    exit
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Group paths by neighbor AS before comparing MED values (`deterministic-med`)
2. Compare MED values across all paths regardless of neighbor AS (`always-compare-med`), treating missing MED attributes as 0 (`zero`)
