To ensure seamless propagation of VPNv4 routes across AS boundaries while maintaining proper route distinguisher and target community handling on Nokia 7750 SRs, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
# Enable inter-AS VPN connectivity (Model B)
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
exit

# Configure neighbor trust for VPN families at inter-AS boundary
configure router bgp
    neighbor-trust vpn-ipv4
exit

# Configure next-hop resolution for VPN routes
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
    family vpn
    exit
exit

# Optional: Enable BGP fast reroute for labeled routes if needed
configure router bgp
    backup-path label-ipv4
exit
```

Key points implemented:
1. Enabled inter-AS VPN functionality with `enable-inter-as-vpn`
2. Established secure label handling with `neighbor-trust vpn-ipv4`
3. Configured next-hop resolution for VPN routes under the appropriate family context
4. Added optional BGP fast reroute capability for labeled IPv4 routes
