Here are the CLI configuration commands needed for seamless VPN route propagation across autonomous systems with strict route control and security:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
    import "VPN_IMPORT_POLICY"
    group "INTER_AS_VPN_PEERS"
        family vpn-ipv4
        family vpn-ipv6
        prefix-limit vpn-ipv4 50000 threshold 75 idle-timeout 30
        prefix-limit vpn-ipv6 25000 threshold 80 idle-timeout 30
exit
```

Key elements implemented:
1. Enabled inter-AS VPN functionality
2. Configured route reflector VPN forwarding
3. Applied strict import policy control
4. Set VPN address family support (IPv4/IPv6)
5. Implemented protective prefix limits with thresholds and automatic recovery

Note: Replace "VPN_IMPORT_POLICY" with your actual route policy name that enforces your security requirements. Adjust prefix limits according to your network scale.
