To enforce validation that the terminating AS in the AS_PATH matches the neighbor's predefined AS number, use the following CLI command under the BGP neighbor configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> enforce-first-as
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<ip-address>` with the neighbor's IP address. This ensures that any incoming BGP updates with a mismatched terminating AS in the AS_PATH will be discarded.
