To enhance BGP session resilience during your upgrade while maintaining existing adjacencies, implement these advanced error-handling mechanisms:

```cli
configure router bgp
    error-handling
    graceful-restart
    enforce-first-as
exit
```

For specific neighbor groups where extended next-hop capabilities are needed:
```cli
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4 vpn-ipv4
exit
```

These configurations will:
1. Enable improved error handling for malformed updates
2. Activate graceful restart helper functionality
3. Enforce AS_PATH validation
4. Add extended next-hop encoding capabilities where required

The changes will take effect immediately for new sessions, while existing sessions will adopt the new parameters upon their next re-establishment.
