To implement extended graceful restart timers for IPv6 peers on Nokia 7750 routers during your dual-stack VPN migration, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        long-lived
            family ipv6
                stale-routes-time 3600
                forwarding-hold-time 3600
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP graceful restart globally
2. Configures long-lived graceful restart (LLGR) specifically for IPv6
3. Sets both stale-routes-time and forwarding-hold-time to 3600 seconds (1 hour)
4. Preserves IPv6 routes during restarts while maintaining forwarding

For additional protection, consider adding these complementary settings:

```cli
configure router bgp
    purge-timer 30
    backup-path ipv6
exit
```

These will:
1. Extend the purge timer for stale routes to 30 minutes
2. Enable BGP fast reroute for IPv6 routes
