Additionally, if you need to enable extended next-hop encoding capabilities for these address families with BGP peers:

```
configure
    router
        bgp
            extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
            rapid-update vpn-ipv4 label-ipv6
            backup-path label-ipv6
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"BMP_STATION_NAME"` with your actual BMP station name. This configuration:
1. Enables BMP monitoring for VPNv4 and labeled IPv6 routes
2. Advertises extended next-hop capability for VPNv4
3. Enables rapid updates for both address families
4. Configures backup path support for labeled IPv6 route
