Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To ensure route stability and forwarding consistency during BGP peer restarts, configure the following settings:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
        stale-routes-time 600
    exit
    damp-peer-oscillations idle-hold-time 10 15 120 error-interval 45
    enable-peer-tracking
exit
```

For specific BGP groups or neighbors where you want to apply these settings more granularly:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
        stale-routes-time 600
    exit
    damp-peer-oscillations idle-hold-time 10 15 120 error-interval 45
    enable-peer-tracking
exit
```

These configurations will:
1. Enable graceful restart with notification support
2. Maintain stale routes for 10 minutes (600 seconds)
3. Control peer oscillation damping with progressive timers
4. Accelerate convergence through immediate peer tracking
