    exit
    damp-peer-oscillations idle-hold-time 10 15 120 error-interval 45
    enable-peer-tracking
exit
```

These configurations will:
1. Enable graceful restart with notification support
2. Maintain stale routes for 10 minutes (600 seconds)
3. Control peer oscillation damping with progressive timers
4. Accelerate convergence through immediate peer tracking
