To ensure immediate route advertisement upon BGP session establishment without introducing convergence delays, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    initial-send-delay-zero
    rapid-withdrawal
    min-route-advertisement 1
exit

configure router bgp group <group-name>
    initial-send-delay-zero
    min-route-advertisement 1
exit

configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    initial-send-delay-zero
    min-route-advertisement 1
exit
```

For scenarios where you want to advertise routes even if they're not the most preferred:

