configure router bgp
    advertise-inactive
exit
```

These settings will:
1. Send updates immediately after session establishment (`initial-send-delay-zero`)
2. Minimize the delay between route advertisements (`min-route-advertisement 1`)
3. Enable fast withdrawal notifications (`rapid-withdrawal`)
4. Optionally advertise inactive routes if needed (`advertise-inactive`)
