To implement a customized login banner displaying the contact information on your Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure
banner login "BMP Station Contact: support@example.com, Phone: +1234567890"
exit
```

This will display the specified contact information whenever a remote technician successfully logs into the router. The banner will be visible after authentication but before gaining access to the CLI prompt.
