2. Restricts inbound eBGP multipath acceptance to only paths from the same neighbor AS (`ebgp 1 restrict same-neighbor-as`)
3. Enables iBGP multipath load balancing (`ibgp-multipath`)
4. Configures asymmetric Add-Path behavior - sending up to 8 unlabeled IPv6 routes while blocking reception of multiple paths (`ipv6 send 8 receive none`)
5. Disables multipath handling for labeled IPv6 routes (`no label-ipv6`)
