To adjust the TCP keepalive probe interval to 30 seconds, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure bmp station "station-name" connection tcp-keepalive
    keep-interval 30
exit
```

Replace `"station-name"` with the actual BMP station name configured on your router. This will set the time between TCP keepalive probes to 30 seconds while maintaining existing connections.
