To prioritize labeled-unicast routes from Juniper peers over Nokia routers by adjusting the local preference to 150 for LU routes in Nokia SR OS BGP, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    group <Juniper_Group_Name>
        local-preference 150
        label-preference 150
exit
```

Replace `<Juniper_Group_Name>` with the actual BGP group name for your Juniper peers. This sets both the local preference and label-specific preference to 150 for routes received from Juniper peers.
