To access the configuration context for BGP-labeled unicast routes and verify next-hop resolution behavior, use the following CLI hierarchy:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family label-ipv4|label-ipv6
                        resolution-filter
                            bgp
```

For example, to configure next-hop resolution for labeled IPv4 routes:
```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family label-ipv4
                        resolution-filter
                            bgp
```
