Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To ensure BGP-labeled prefixes properly resolve via LDP nexthops on your 7750 SR, configure the following:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter ldp
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Additionally, if you need to advertise LDP FEC prefixes to BGP peers with RFC 3107 labels, enable this per neighbor:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    family ipv4
        advertise-ldp-prefix
    exit
exit
``` 

These configurations will ensure LDP-derived nexthop information is properly incorporated into BGP route resolution while maintaining label advertisement capabilities where needed.
