Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To ensure BGP-labeled prefixes resolve via LDP for next-hop resolution on your Nokia 7750, configure the following:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter ldp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you also want to prioritize LDP over other tunnel types while allowing fallback options, you can specify multiple protocols in the resolution filter (order matters):

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter ldp bgp rsvp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

These configurations will force the system to use LDP tunnels for resolving BGP-labeled IPv4 prefixes' next-hops.
