Here are the CLI configuration commands to propagate IS-IS topology into BGP-LS while maintaining accurate TE attributes:

```
configure router bgp
    link-state-import-enable
    group "BGP-LS-PEERS"
        type internal
        neighbor <controller-ip>
            family link-state
            export "LS-EXPORT-POLICY"
exit
```

Additional notes:
1. Ensure IS-IS is properly configured with TE extensions enabled
2. Create a route policy named "LS-EXPORT-POLICY" to control which TE attributes are exported
3. The BGP session should be established with your centralized controller using the specified neighbor IP

For Segment Routing integration with IS-IS:
```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution shortcut-tunn family ipv4 resolution-filter sr-isis
```
