To configure your Nokia PE routers to propagate up to eight distinct BGP paths for each mVPNv4 prefix while maintaining compatibility with remote peers capable of multipath route exchange, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

If you also need to enable this for mVPNv6 prefixes, add:
```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
