"During our multicast IPv6 VPN deployment on Nokia routers, we need to ensure that BGP can propagate up to eight distinct paths for each prefix while maintaining reciprocal capability to accept multiple received routes for identical prefixes—what’s the optimal way to implement this multipath negotiation?"
