To enforce a default MED of 200 for all routes where the metric isn't specifically defined in the policy configurations, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp med-out 200
```

This will apply a MED value of 200 to all BGP route advertisements where the MED isn't explicitly set by policy configurations. You can apply this at the global BGP level, group level, or neighbor level depending on your specific requirements. For example, to apply it to a specific group:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> med-out 200
```
