To enforce a 15-second minimum interval between outgoing BGP route advertisements on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI configuration command:

```
configure router bgp min-route-advertisement 15
```

This will set the minimum route advertisement interval to 15 seconds globally for all BGP peers. If you need to apply this setting to specific groups or neighbors instead, navigate to the respective context (`config>router>bgp>group` or `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor`) and execute the same command there.
