To configure the IPv4 time-to-live (TTL) parameter to 128 specifically for EBGP traffic on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <your_ebgp_group_name>
        multihop 128
exit all
```

Replace `<your_ebgp_group_name>` with the name of your EBGP group. This configuration ensures that EBGP updates will have a TTL of 128 when sent to peers, allowing them to traverse multiple hops without being dropped due to TTL expiration.
