Here are the CLI configuration commands to enable load balancing across up to eight EBGP routes with consistent AS-path attributes:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 ebgp 8 restrict exact-as-path
    best-path-selection
        ignore-router-id
    exit
exit
```

Explanation:
1. `multipath 8 ebgp 8` enables load balancing for up to 8 EBGP paths
2. `restrict exact-as-path` ensures only paths with identical AS-path attributes to the best path are considered
3. `ignore-router-id` prevents router ID comparisons from affecting path selection

These commands will allow equal-cost multipath routing for EBGP prefixes while strictly enforcing AS-path consistency across all selected paths.
