To enhance BGP route reflection efficiency on your Nokia platforms during a multi-vendor core network upgrade, implement the following streamlined configuration:

```cli
# Enable optimal route reflection to minimize path attributes and reduce update processing
configure router bgp
    optimal-route-reflection
exit

# Configure BGP to ignore router-ID comparisons for more stable path selection
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ignore-router-id
exit

# Enable iBGP multipath for load balancing across multiple paths
configure router bgp
    ibgp-multipath
exit

# Reduce convergence time by sending updates immediately after session establishment
configure router bgp
    initial-send-delay-zero
exit

# Enable BGP fast reroute for rapid failover to backup paths
configure router bgp
    backup-path ipv4 ipv6 label-ipv4 label-ipv6
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Optimize route reflection processing
2. Stabilize path selection during upgrades
3. Improve resource utilization through multipath
4. Accelerate convergence
5. Provide fast reroute capabilities

The configuration minimizes manual adjustments while improving overall BGP efficiency during the upgrade process.
