Here are the recommended CLI configuration commands to assign 192.0.2.10 as the primary IPv4 loopback for your route reflector cluster:

```
configure router bgp
    optimal-route-reflection
        location 1 primary-ip-address 192.0.2.10
    exit
    cluster 192.0.2.10 orr-location 1
    backup-path ipv4
exit
```

This configuration:
