2. Sets up the route reflector cluster using the same IP as the cluster ID
3. Associates the cluster with the ORR location
4. Enables BGP fast reroute for IPv4 routes

For additional stability, consider adding these complementary commands:
```
configure router bgp
    loop-detect discard-route
    best-path-selection
        ignore-router-id
    exit
exit
```
