To enforce a 15-minute expiration threshold for stale VPN-IP prefixes when route refresh messages aren't received from peers, use the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    purge-timer 15
exit
```

This sets the maximum time before stale VPN-IP routes are purged to 15 minutes when they aren't refreshed by the peer. The default value is 10 minutes.
