To adjust the filter-type parameter for proper next-hop resolution of labeled BGP routes while maintaining existing L3VPN services, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution
    labeled-routes
        transport-tunnel family ipv4
            resolution-filter bgp
            resolution-filter rsvp
```

This configuration ensures BGP will first attempt to resolve next-hops using BGP-labeled routes and fall back to RSVP tunnels if needed, providing correct path selection without disrupting L3VPN services.
