To enforce selective binding of BGP-labeled routes to specific MPLS tunnel types (RSVP-TE or SR-TE) for certain peers without impacting other transport paths, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure
    router
        bgp
            next-hop-resolution
                labeled-routes
                    transport-tunnel
