        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter rsvp sr-te
                    exit
                exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution filter
                        resolution-filter rsvp sr-te
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Sets the resolution mode to `filter` for both shortcut tunnels and labeled routes
2. Explicitly includes only `rsvp` and `sr-te` in the resolution filter
3. Automatically excludes all other tunnel types from being considered for BGP prefix resoluti
