To implement BGP graceful restart with a 600-second timeout for session re-establishment before routes are withdrawn, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 600
        stale-routes-time 600
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

If you need to apply these settings at the group or neighbor level instead of globally, replace `config>router>bgp` with the appropriate context (`config>router>bgp>group` or `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor`) in the command structure above.
