   mp-bgp-keep
   ```

5. To configure RIB-API for shortcut tunnel resolution (if applicable):
   ```
   shortcut-tunn family resolution-filter rib-api
   ```

These commands allow you to safely adjust RIB parameters while maintaining active BGP sessions.
