To implement selective BGP monitoring that exclusively captures and forwards post-policy route monitoring updates, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor
        route-monitoring post-policy
    exit
exit
```

This ensures the BGP monitor session only advertises post-policy route monitoring messages with the preserved path attributes for analysis.
