To direct all BMP session traffic exclusively through the "customerA_vpn12" routing instance, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "station_name"
            connection
                router "customerA_vpn12"
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"station_name"` with your actual BMP station name. This configuration ensures all BMP session traffic is routed through the specified VPRN instance.
