To configure BMP session monitoring for your VPRN service "customer-backbone" on the Nokia 7750 platform, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP-Monitor"
            connection 1
                router service-name "customer-backbone"
                no shutdown
            exit
            monitor
                route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For the BGP configuration within the VPRN service to support BMP monitoring:

```
configure
    service
        vprn "customer-backbone"
            bgp
                monitor
                    route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
                exit
            exit
            no shutdown
        exit
    exit
```

These commands will:
1. Create a BMP monitoring station named "BMP-Monitor"
2. Establish the BMP connection through the "customer-backbone" VPRN service
3. Enable both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring
4. Configure the same monitoring settings within the VPRN's BGP instance
------------
