To resolve the BGP-labeled next-hop issues on your Nokia Route Reflectors without LDP or RSVP-TE involvement, enable the IGP route table lookup for next-hop resolution with the following command:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes
    rr-use-route-table
exit
```

This will allow the Route Reflector to use the IGP routing table for resolving next-hops of label-IPv4 and label-IPv6 routes while maintaining its RR functionality.
