To configure a secondary IPv4 address (192.168.100.10) for BGP optimal route reflection on your Nokia 7750 SR without disrupting existing peer sessions, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    optimal-route-reflection
        location 1
            secondary-ip-address 192.168.100.10
        exit
    exit
exit
```

If you also want to enable BGP fast reroute for IPv4 routes to further optimize path selection, add:

```
configure router bgp
    backup-path ipv4
exit
``` 

These commands will assign the secondary address while maintaining existing peer sessions and improving path selection capabilities.
