To configure your Nokia router to exchange only prefixes tagged with the extended community target `192.0.2.10:65535` via ORF capability with your partner AS, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "PARTNER_AS_GROUP"
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                send-orf target:192.0.2.10:65535
                accept-orf
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `"PARTNER_AS_GROUP"` with your actual BGP group name for the partner AS. This configuration enables both sending and accepting ORF filters specifically for the extended community target `192.0.2.10:65535`.
