exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your actual BGP group name. This configuration will:
1. Send link-bandwidth attributes to EBGP peers for IPv4 routes
2. Accept and process incoming link-bandwidth attributes from EBGP peers
3. Automatically add link-bandwidth attributes to routes received from directly connected EBGP peers
4. Aggregate bandwidth values from multipath routes when advertising with next-hop-self
5. Preserve third-party next-hop information when applicable
