## Proposed answer:
To adjust the SPF calculation intervals for optimal BGP route reflection with the specified timing parameters, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp optimal-route-reflection
    spf-wait 120 initial-wait 10 second-wait 30
exit
```

This configuration sets:
- Initial SPF delay (initial-wait) = 10 seconds
- Subsequent delay increment (second-wait) = 30 seconds 
- Maximum interval cap (max-wait) = 120 second
