To configure BGP on your Nokia 7750 routers to dynamically resolve next-hops via IS-IS-advertised segment routing tunnels during the MPLS-to-SR migration, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn ipv4
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter sr-isis
                    exit
                exit
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel family ipv4
                    resolution-filter sr-isis
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration ensures BGP uses IS-IS-advertised segment routing tunnels for next-hop resolution while maintaining existing forwarding paths. The `sr-isis` filter prioritizes IS-IS-programmed SR tunnels in the tunnel table for both shortcut and labeled route resolution.
