To prioritize SRv6 tunnels learned via OSPFv3 for BGP next-hop resolution of IPv6 routes, configure the following:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnel
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter sr-ospf
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration ensures that SRv6 tunnels installed by OSPFv3 take precedence over other tunnel types when resolving BGP next-hops for IPv6 traffic. The order of tunnel types in the resolution filter determines their priority, with only `sr-ospf` specified here to exclusively use OSPFv3-programmed SRv6 tunnels.
