To ensure BGP-learned IPv6 routes preferentially use OSPFv3-originated SRv6 paths for next-hop resolution, configure the following:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn ipv6
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter sr-ospf3
                    exit
                exit
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel ipv6
                    family ipv6
                        resolution-filter sr-ospf3
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration explicitly filters tunnel selection to only consider OSPFv3-programmed SRv6 paths for both unlabeled and labeled BGP IPv6 route resolution.
