Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
Here are the CLI configuration commands to establish BMP telemetry streams to both NYC-DC1 and LAX-DC2 collectors:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "NYC-DC1"
            no shutdown
            connection
                router base
                exit
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
            exit
        station "LAX-DC2"
            no shutdown
            connection
                router base
                exit
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

To apply BMP monitoring at the global BGP instance level:
```
configure
    router
        bgp
            monitor
                station "NYC-DC1" "LAX-DC2"
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

These configurations will:
1. Create two BMP stations (NYC-DC1 and LAX-DC2)
2. Enable both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring
3. Use the base routing instance for connections
4. Apply the monitoring at the global BGP level
