To configure a 5-minute interval for BMP statistics transmissions while maintaining existing QoS policies, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
bmp
    station "BMP_COLLECTOR_NAME"
        connection
            tcp-keepalive
                keep-interval 300
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This sets the BMP station's TCP keepalive interval to 300 seconds (5 minutes), ensuring consistent flow telemetry data delivery to your collector without affecting existing QoS policies.
