To implement UDP encapsulation for BGP-labeled unicast routes' next-hop resolution during your migration from MPLS LDP to segment routing on Nokia 7750 routers, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter
                            udp
                            bgp
                            no ldp
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For BGP groups or neighbors where you need to specify the default encapsulation type for EVPN routes, add:

```
configure router
    bgp
        group <group-name>
            def-recv-evpn-encap vxlan
        exit
        neighbor <ip-address>
            def-recv-evpn-encap vxlan
        exit
    exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable UDP and BGP tunneling while disabling LDP for IPv4 labeled route next-hop resolution
2. Set the default EVPN encapsulation to VXLAN when none is received (adjust to mpls if needed)
