To selectively disable destination prefix validation for BGP FlowSpec while maintaining other validations, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp flowspec
    no validate-dest-prefix
exit
```

This command will disable validation specifically for destination prefixes in FlowSpec rules while leaving other FlowSpec component validations intact. The default behavior is already `no validate-dest-prefix`, so this explicitly confirms that setting if it was previously enabled.
