---
## Proposed answer:
To ensure your base routing instance BGP export policies propagate to VPNv4 routes, use the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    vpn-apply-export
    exit
```

If you also want to maintain MP-BGP routes during policy changes without requiring route refresh:
```
configure router bgp
    mp-bgp-keep
    exit
```

These commands will apply your base instance export policies to VPN routes and preserve MP-BGP routes during policy updates.
