To implement selective add-path behavior for VPN-IPv4 routes on the Nokia 7750 SR, limiting the advertisement to a maximum of eight paths per NLRI prefix and preventing the acceptance of additional paths from peers, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp add-paths
    vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive none
exit
```

This configuration:
- Sets the `send-limit` to `8` for VPN-IPv4 routes, ensuring no more than eight paths per NLRI prefix are advertised.
- Uses `receive none` to disable the acceptance of additional paths from peers.
- Maintains existing VPNv4 sessions without disruption.
