To configure your Nokia router to advertise a maximum of eight distinct VPN-IPv6 route paths while preventing the acceptance of any incoming VPN-IPv6 routes from peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
exit
